  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: the bus no longer resets the interface during retries; IPhysicalLayer.ResetInterface and FatalEssyBusException are gone, and so is the fatal state. A broken link is the physical layer's to repair: it reconnects and throws a PhysicalLayerException, and the bus retries on the new link. A failing transaction now gets 3 retries (4 attempts) instead of 19. IPhysicalLayer.InterruptLineChange is renamed InterruptAsserted: it is raised while the interrupt line is asserted, never when it is released.",
